# Allowlist: upload only what the web app needs. Keeps pyproject.toml (worker deps) out so
# Vercel installs requirements.txt only, and keeps databases, logs and secrets out.
/*
!app.py
!requirements.txt
!.python-version
!vercel.json
# /companies reads the watchlist (public repo files, no secrets).
!config.yaml
!companies.resolved.yaml
!src
